---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---


	<BaseLayout>
		<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 text-gray-800">
			<h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-8">
				Privacy Policy
			</h1>

			<p class="mb-6">
				This Privacy Policy describes how the personal data of users who
				access and use the website <strong>ivansevilla.me</strong>{" "}
				(hereinafter, "the Website") is collected, used, and protected.
			</p>

			<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">
				1. Data Controller
			</h2>
			<ul class="list-disc pl-6 mb-6">
				<li>
					<strong>Name:</strong> Iván Sevilla Gómez
				</li>
				<li>
					<strong>Contact email:</strong> ivansevillagomez@gmail.com
				</li>
				<li>
					<strong>Purpose of the website:</strong> Personal and
					professional portfolio.
				</li>
			</ul>

			<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">
				2. Data Collected and Purpose
			</h2>
			<p class="mb-4">
				When browsing and using this Website, the following data may be
				collected:
			</p>
			<ul class="list-disc pl-6 mb-6">
				<li>
					<strong>Through the contact form:</strong> Name and email.
					This data is used exclusively to respond to inquiries,
					messages, or proposals sent by the user.
				</li>
			</ul>

			<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">
				3. Legal Basis for Data Processing
			</h2>
			<p class="mb-4">
				The legal basis for processing your data is{" "}
				<strong>express consent</strong>.
			</p>
			<ul class="list-disc pl-6 mb-6">
				<li>
					By checking the acceptance box in the contact form, you give
					your consent for your data to be processed for the purpose
					of responding to your message.
				</li>
			</ul>

			<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">
				4. Data Retention Period
			</h2>
			<ul class="list-disc pl-6 mb-6">
				<li>
					Data sent through the contact form will be kept for the time
					necessary to resolve the inquiry raised.
				</li>
			</ul>

			<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">
				5. Data Communication to Third Parties
			</h2>
			<p class="mb-4">
				Your data will not be sold, rented, or transferred to third
				parties, except due to legal obligation. However, for the
				operation of the Website, third-party services are used that may
				have access to certain data:
			</p>

			<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">
				6. Your Rights
			</h2>
			<p class="mb-4">
				As a user, you have the right to:
			</p>
			<ul class="list-disc pl-6 mb-6">
				<li>Request access to your personal data.</li>
				<li>
					Request its rectification or deletion (right to be
					forgotten).
				</li>
				<li>Request the limitation of its processing.</li>
				<li>Object to the processing.</li>
				<li>Withdraw the consent granted at any time.</li>
			</ul>
			<p class="mb-6">
				To exercise any of these rights, you can send an email to{" "}
				<strong>ivansevillagomez@gmail.com</strong> indicating "Data
				Protection" in the subject line.
			</p>

			<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">
				7. Changes to the Privacy Policy
			</h2>
			<p class="mb-6">
				I reserve the right to modify this Privacy Policy to adapt it to
				legislative or jurisprudential developments. I recommend
				checking it periodically.
			</p>

			<p class="text-sm mt-12 border-t pt-6">
				<em>Last updated: October 2026</em>
			</p>
		</div>
	</BaseLayout>
